.TH CHATBRIDGE 1 "October 2026" "chatbridge 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
chatbridge \- two-way chat history sync between Cursor and Claude
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chatbridge
.I command
[options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
ChatBridge reads chats from Cursor and sessions from Claude (desktop app and Claude Code), pairs the ones that belong
together and appends the messages each side is missing to the other. Messages, reasoning and tool calls are kept.
Syncing is append-only and idempotent; nothing is rewritten or deleted. Every command is a dry run unless
.B \-\-apply
is given, and nothing is selected implicitly.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
Show all conversations with their sync state.
.TP
.B sync
Sync or import the selected conversations. Select with
.BI \-\-chat " ID"
(Cursor chat id prefix),
.BI \-\-claude " KEY"
(Claude session key or id prefix),
.B \-\-linked
(every paired conversation) or
.B \-\-all
(everything in both tools).
.TP
.B watch
Auto-sync loop for already linked conversations (\fB\-\-interval\fR seconds, \fB\-\-once\fR for one pass).
.TP
.B cursor\-undo
Revert one write made into Cursor, using the journal printed by
.BR sync :
.BI \-\-journal " FILE".
.TP
.B doctor
Print what ChatBridge can see on this machine.
.TP
.B inventory, import, verify, undo
The original one-way Cursor to Claude importer commands.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-apply
Write changes (default: dry run).
.TP
.BI \-\-direction " both|to\-claude|to\-cursor"
Limit the sync direction.
.TP
.BI \-\-cursor\-profile " LABEL"
Cursor profile that receives new chats created from Claude.
.TP
.BI \-\-profile " LABEL=PATH"
Additional (backup) Cursor user-data folder, read-only.
.SH SAFETY
Cursor is never written while it is running on the target profile; such changes are deferred. Every write into a
Cursor database is journaled in ~/.local/share/chatbridge/journal and can be reverted with
.BR cursor\-undo .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/chatbridge/
Link database, undo journals, undone imports.
.TP
.I ~/.config/chatbridge/settings.json
Settings of the graphical application.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR chatbridge\-gui (1),
https://github.com/pwnapplehat/chatbridge
